  "sourceNotes": [
    "Every system transfers a reusable mechanism without publishing private workspace content, account details, local paths, client material, or credentials.",
    "System 02 uses a metadata-only Skills HQ and a proposal-only improvement loop. It does not read private chat logs or apply changes automatically.",
    "System 09 contains a neutral original starter and requires users to install and license third-party tools for their own use.",
    "System 10 is public-ready with tested portable mechanics and a documented proof boundary. Its first full long-form production run still requires separate human review before any broader performance claim."
  ]
